# No fabricated proposal values (generate · Complete Scan · chat)

Every path that writes manuscript content MUST run the zero-fabrication guard
stack before persisting. Never ship invented facts, carriers, certs, team
members, rates, or compliance statuses.

## Mandatory hook

`apply_zero_fabrication_guards` / `apply_zero_fabrication_guards_before_persist`
in `proposal_zero_fabrication.py` — canonical order:

1. Manuscript integrity (references, case-study overbuild, pricing tiers)
2. Reference contact evidence (no full contacts without KB proof)
3. Budget sync / ceiling scrub (canonical ledger wins)
4. Fabricated qualifications guard (invented clients / case studies)
5. Insurance certification gate (no Compliant without Section 1.5 / companyfacts)
6. Cert claim scrub (MBE/DBE, individual platform certs as agency-wide, etc.)
7. Fabricated personnel scrub (Brittany Frazier, Drew Stone, … → MANUAL FILL)
8. Forms & Attachments integrity (LLM audit + verbatim replace only) on persist

## Where it MUST run

| Path | When |
|------|------|
| **Generate proposal** | Phase 3.5 budget + post–self-edit final (`apply_zero_fabrication_guards_before_persist`) |
| **Complete Scan** | Preflight + **after stage 17 quality gate** (final `before_persist`) |
| **Section chat** | Every `_persist_section_improve_draft` save (`chat-persist`) |

## Never fabricate

- Insurance carriers, NAIC numbers, policy issuers, or "Compliant" / "meets or exceeds"
- Hourly labor rates or cost rows when budget is fixed/phased / MANUAL FILL
- Full reference contacts when KB shows incomplete / withheld
- Agency certifications not in companyfacts (MBE/DBE, WBE Oregon-only, etc.)
- Team member names not in 04_Bio / MasterTemplate
- Past-proven delivery claims without case-study / bio evidence
- Vendor registration, download, or procurement attestations without proof
- Budget totals, phase tables, or ceiling figures not from canonical ledger

## Chat / LLM edits

- Post-LLM hooks are additive; **persist guard is the hard gate**.
- Chat ops (`remove_fabricated`, content-risk repair) do not replace persist guards.
- Replace invented bio sentences with 04_Bio wording — never delete and leave Role-only gaps.

## Evidence

- LLM judgment + verbatim quote replace for forms/compliance fixes.
- No regex synonym tables for capability or carrier matching (see `no-regex-evidence-matching.mdc`).
